5.0,"[font=Times New Roman][size=3][color=white]Million Dollar Baby has to be the most emotionally true film since Lost in Translation.  Im not going to spoil it for those of you that have not seen it.  That has been done by some idiotic right wing pill popping idiot and Michael Medevd. This film is not in anyway in overtly political film.  It has something it in it that is considered a political issue but it comes from a character driven emotional place.  The brilliance of Eastwood is that he takes what would be cliché in other films and makes them tales of morality and redemption.  This is really a movie about a father and daughter and what their love for each others does for them.  One of them has to make the hardest choice one can make.[/color][/size][/font]

[size=3][font=Times New Roman][color=white]That is all that Im going to say.  This is a film that works on so many levels.  I believe that it is as emotionally true as a film can get.  The boxing is interesting and you can see the dedication that goes into it.   Maggie is somebody that never backs down and is always up for a challenge. I was surprised by how optimistic her character was.  She rarely complained and tried to make the best out of everything.  When she does speak up she does it for good reason.  [/color][/font][/size]

[font=Times New Roman][size=3][color=white]I thought that Frankies and Maggies relationship could have descended into cliché. Yet again, this is the beauty of Eastwoods cinema.  He allows his characters to be human and gives them room to breath. We accept what they do better because they are real people, as real as somebody in a movie can get, that gives them the right to be who they are and do what they do.  Also worth noting is the performance of Morgan Freeman. He really adds the film its heart and soul through his narration.  I really admired all three of the leads as this is a great film and you cannot ask for something better.[/color][/size][/font]","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2005-02-06","","RT","900614236"
5.0,"[font=Arial Black][size=4][color=blue]Million Dollar Baby is an awsome movie but very sad , it has a whole twist to it.[/color][/size][/font]","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2005-02-06","","RT","900675948"
