4.5,"I know people may probably be wondering why i didn't give 10's to all these amazing oscar nominees. Well, they were all excellent, but I put a lot of weight into how much a film effects me and how deeply involved and immersed i am while watching it.
  
  [img]http://ia.imdb.com/media/imdb/01/I/50/47/58m.jpg[/img] [img]http://i.imdb.com/Photos/Ss/0405159/th-MDD-1761R_V2.jpg[/img] [img]http://i.imdb.com/Photos/Ss/0405159/th-MDD-7625.jpg[/img]
  
