[font=Garamond][size=3]Good enough to watch once. Excellently placed around Valentine's Day. It's a date movie. Of course I didn't go with one, but still, it was an enjoyable sit, a nice breath of fresh air, especially at the start. At the end, however, it became too metaphorical and preachy for a romantic comedy. Will Smith does all right, but Kevin James shines more so.[/size][/font]
 
 
