nd alex comes 2 pick me up. we head over 2 cold stone 2 visit paretti at work. it was awesome seeing as she gave us ice cream 4 cheaper than we were supposed 2 b charged. so i gave her a big tip :-D. we then go and pick up nora....who claims mike doesnt have a family :-P. then we go and pick up greg and decide 2 go 2 jacks. we got 2 c the end of scanners which consisted of watching a guys face melt...hmm. then alex took me home and after being rudely kicked off the computer by jake and not being able 2 say goodbye 2 the people i was talking 2 (i was having some pretty good conversations 2) i decided since it was a highly emotional night 2 watch Million Dollar Baby. One of the best movies I have ever seen by far. Clint Eastwood, Hilary Swank, and Morgan Freeman were positively flawless. If i could rate higher than a 10 for this movie I would. So now im up at 3 o'clock in the morning and sad that spencer is gone because he would b up talking 2 me if he was here! :'(. anyway i hope i can see alot of people 2morrow since im almost completely free. love you all. 
