3.5,"My holidays are coming to an end. We're back in Melbourne and Max is back at work. Next week I'll be back at uni. Before we left Gippsland to return to The Big Stink, we managed to see some good flicks.
 
 Sin City finally graced our (Australian) shores on Thursday. Me and some mates went and saw it that afternoon. I had heard good things about it but I wasn't sure just what to expect. I loved this film. It was original, snappy, entertaining fun. Everything about it was fantastic, there were no obvious negative points. Best film of 2005 to date. (*****)
 
 The only thing that left me scratching my head is [b]why the hell did we have to wait three months for this flick?![/b] I can think of no good reason for it. There was about at most 10 other people apart from our mates in the cinema. If it was delayed so that they could sell more tickets, I think they may have failed.
 
