2.5,"Mabye i'm just a sucker for the ""training parts"" of movies, ala SWAT, Training Day, Rocky... the one thing all these movies have in common is they manage to wet my appetite without bedding it down. For me, million dollar baby simply ran out of steam. I understand Eastwood wanted to bring to the screen the pain Swank was feeling, but shit - I'd rather Morgan Freeman just crept in her room, mabye said something creepy about her hair and smothered her last gasp of fresh air away with a sweaty gym rag.

