3.0,"Went to the Public Employment Security Ofiice(The job replacement office?). The first day of a job hunting. There were so many people there. I felt how high the jobless rate in Japan is. Oh, gees. Asked a worker if I was allowed to use a computer there. Used one, and find a interesting job. I printed out a page and showed a worker. I had a counceling, then the councelor called the company. The representitive was out. He told them I'd call them later.
 
A man at the entrance talked to me suddenly, asked if I got a good job or not. He also asked me to be a soldier in the army. Answered I'm a office worker type.
 
Headed to the university I studied at. I wanted to say hello to my teacher. I'd emailed him, but I haven't heard anything from him. I guesss he might have changed his email address. I checked his office, but nobody was there. I should've gone there at the office hour (that is the time he's available).
 
Had lunch at a German restaurant called ""Berg"" which means mountain. I often went there when I was an university student. The ice age in my life.
 
Went to a instrumental store. I wanna buy a bass guitar, but cheap one. I didn't see what I wanted.
 
Went home and called the company. The representitive told me I have an interview tomorrow morning at 10:00.
 
I needed papers for resume. Went to a stationery store.
 
Went home again. Watched Mistic river, but I was a bit sleepy I didn't see all. Oh, I saw Million Dollar Baby yesterday. It was....sad, a bit shocking. Everyone expects this like rocky, though, this movie is totaly opposite. It gets people desperate. I don't know whether it's a good movie or not, but I can say it's not a typical hollywood movie. It doesn't give you hope. No Catharsis. Just.....oh, I'm not saying anymore.
 
I got some rental dvds again. It's a movie month.","",False,False,False,False,3.0,"2006-06-12","","RT","900841488"
