4.0,"[url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/dvd.php?select=3""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/coverv/33/243733.jpg[/img][/font][/url]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS]First thing I have to say is I liked Hillary Swank before y'all knew who she was! [/font]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_26_thumb.jpg[/img] [/font][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=19&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_19_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=14&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_14_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS]She was INCREDIBLE in this movie as a 30ish young lady who wanted to turn to boxing to make something out of herself.[/font]
 
[url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=27&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_27_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=16&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_16_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=24&size=lores&nopop=1""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_24_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS]When she begins to go to the gym she faces immediate discrimination but battles through it with a great attitude and wins over her trainer, Clint Eastwood.[/font]
 
[url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=30&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_30_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=21&size=lores&nopop=1""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_21_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=3&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_03_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS]Morgan Freeman is also in this movie as the friendly and wise gym custodian. He was excellent as usual.[/font]
 
[url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=13&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_13_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=5&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_05_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url][url=""http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/million_dollar_baby/gallery.php?page=6&size=lores""][font=Comic Sans MS][img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1139338/photo_06_thumb.jpg[/img][/font][/url]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS]Maggie Fitzgerald(Swank) works her way up after her trainer(Eastwood) finally takes her in and they get past the discrimination. The movie is exciting and meaningful. [/font]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS]THEN THE END HAPPENS! OMG! It was one of the most disappointing endings I've ever seen. It shocked everyone but I hated it! Some people like those kinds of endings but I actually like the world and I like happy endings. I liked Rocky II, Karate Kids I,II and III and the Price of Glory. I hated the ending in this film. [/font]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS]Even with the horrendous ending, I do reccommend this movie. It's a good ride![/font]

[font=Comic Sans MS]Interesting Facts:[/font]
[font=Comic Sans MS]Everyone wants to know what ""Mo Cuishle"" means as it was used in the movie. Here's what I found....[/font]
[size=1][url=""http://www.learnirishgaelic.com/articles/article-89-10.html""][color=black]http://www.learnirishgaelic.com/articles/article-89-10.html[/color][/url][color=black] ""The movie Million Dollar Baby uses the term or endearment [b]Mo cuishle[/b]. This is and Irish Gaelic term of endearment. However, it is incorrectly spelt, the correct spelling being [b]Mo chuisle[/b].[/color][/size]
[color=black] [/color]
[b][size=1][color=black]Meaning: [/color][/size][size=1][color=black]Mo chuisle literally means ""my pulse"". It's from a longer phrase: A chuisle mo chroí, which means ""pulse of my heart"". It does not mean ""my blood"". It's an endearment. Normally when speaking TO the person, you would say ""a chuisle""... you would only use ""mo chuisle"" when speaking OF the person. [/color]
[color=black] [/color]
[color=black]The correct spelling is ""Mo chuisle"". [/color][/size][/b]
[color=black] [/color]
[b][size=1][color=black]Pronunciation: [/color][/size][size=1][color=black]Mo chuisle[/color]
[/size][size=1][i][color=black]muh khwish-la[/color]
[/i][color=black]Literally: my pulse[/color]
[color=black]Overall meaning: my darling"" [/color][/size][/b]
 

 
