4.5,"I have to start by saying I hate the so called ""sport"" we know as boxing. That being said, and putting my prejudice aside, I found this picture depicting a fight greater than the ones being fought in the ring. And although I thought the whole boxing theme was going to throw me off, since the moment I pushed play, my mind got completely engaged on this story of fighting for what we really want. 

This is a tale of perseverance, of proving wrong everyone that never believed in us, of going against the tide (oh boy, tell me about it), and more than anything, a tale of two hearts who found in each other, what they believed impossible, someone to trust, and to love as the family they never had. 

Hillary Swank truly deserved the Oscar for best-actress for a performance that had me paralyzed on my chair for the two hours of running film.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2006-08-23","","RT","138125416"
