2.0,"Million Dollar Baby, 2004
Headliners: Clint Eastwood, Hilary Swank
Director: Clint Eastwood

4 out of 10  :down: 

How Sideways and Eternal Sunshine lost to this hack job is a mystery to me.This movie is bad. It is badly written and its emotions are spoon-fed to you like you're the Million Dollar Baby. Swank's preformance is good, so is Freeman's but Eastwood suffers from stale acting. And Freeman narrating has been done before; can you say the Shawshank Redemption? This film suffers from the same thing as About Schmidt in many places; it is done by a director with much better projects nder his belt, irt is spoon-fed to us and all of the metaphors are far too obvious. It is visually stunning, buty that alone is not enough to make a movie good. The most overblown title in years.","",False,False,False,False,2.0,"2006-12-03","","RT","900922401"
