5.0,"Clint Eastwood does it again with Million Dollar Baby. This movie has not made me stop thinking of what life and death really mean. Eastwood puts on his strongest performance since Absolute Power. Like many critics have said, this is one of the bravest, truly honest & most simple movies to ever be made. Roger Ebert also said, ""Movies are so often made of effects and sensation these days. This one is made of three people and how their actions grow out of who they are and why. Nothing else. But isn't that everything?"" Hilary Swank puts on the most complete performance of her acting career. It is no wonder why the Hollywood Foreign Press awarded her the Best Actress Golden Globe last night. While watching the film, you feel the emotion her character Maggie is going through. Now I can't forget about the superb Morgan Freeman. Like always, he puts on a great performance & better yet, he narrates throughout the film. So if you are looking for a great film, then look no further and experience the masterpiece that is Million Dollar Baby.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-05-28","","RT","781736284"
