4.0,"Great film that deserved all the hype and awards it received. Kudos to Hilary Swank in particular for bringing so much heart into the film. The same goes for Eastwood's direction--a vast improvement over Mystic River. Its too bad though that both Benning and Swank couldn't both go home with Oscars both times they went head to head. The triumph and eventual demise of the lead character was so gritty and in your face that it made you engage that much more with the characters. Regardless of the controversy of the final scenes I still feel this shouldn't dtract from the overall beauty of the film.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-05-30","","RT","781996853"
5.0,"One of the greatest films of the decade, and certainly the best boxing drama since RAGING BULL (1980). It is emotionally potent, stark, superbly acted, as well as unpredictably tragic. Everyone here, from Clint Eastwood to Morgan Freeman, give Oscar worthy performances. I highly recommended this film, as it is old school filmmaking at its best. One of Clint Eastwood's best films ever.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-05-30","","RT","782032599"
