5.0,"Another Oscar winng film by Clint Eastwood.

Hillary Swank plays a female boxer who comes to Eastwoods gym to be trained. She is befriended by Morgan Freeman, an ex boxer, and Eastwood his manager.

The friendship between Freeman and Eastwood is a truly sad one, when Freeman was boxing, Clint didnt end a brutal fight and Freeman was forced to retire after the fight.

The swank/eastwood friendship starts out bitter then becomes a father/daughter relationship.

This is a very touching and moving movie. Eastwood, Swank and Freeman won Oscars for this film.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-10","","RT","782532136"
