4.5,"Clint Eastwood delivers with a powerful masterpiece. Clint Eastwood, Hilary Swank,and Morgan Freeman are superb in this film. I went and saw this film knowing nothing about it except that it was at the dollar theater and I was bored. It turned out to be one of the best films I've ever seen. This boxing film can now claim the high ground along with Raging Bull and Rocky. It turned away from the predictability of most sports films, and delves into the deep physical, emotional,and spiritual sides of these characters lives. You come to love, and hate these characters and involve yourself, almost not knowing that you are, through out the film. You support and hate the ending. Not hating it because it's bad, more over that it is a heart crusher. A great piece of story telling, directing, and terrific acting on all fronts. More than a sports film, it is a film about the soul","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-06-13","","RT","782107243"
