4.5,"This is a sports movie and more specifically a boxing one, which entails to a few cliches here and there. But, the film is so much more about boxing and delivers on the human emotion that goes into boxing, as well as the relationships created from it. The performances from the big three (Swank, Freeman, and Eastwood) are all powerful and award worthy. Not to mention Eastwood's direction is sharp and adds a gritty feel to the world of women's boxing. The film does head down ""Heartbreak Road"" leaving to a slightly depressing ending, but the adventure to it is worth the tears in the end.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-07-10","","RT","782458100"
