5.0,"14. Million Dollar Baby - With some of the best acting from numerous actors in one film, this powerful, emotional, inspiring, and heartbreaking film is definatly a must because of Hilary Swank alone. But of course this film needs more than great acting to make my list and it doesnt disapoint. This winner of four oscars gives Morgan Freeman his first gold statue and Hilary Swank her second with their great performances. An inspiring movie about not only fighting in the ring (which she kicks ass) but fighting to get in the ring with the cards your delt, even when everyone says you cant, and succeeding. This heartbreaking film about being at rock bottom, to climbing your way to the top, to being right back at rock bottom again with one ring of the bell is an emotional film with incredible heart and an extremely emotional ending that begs to be acknowledge as great, and i do.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-08-01","","RT","789317489"
