4.5,"The wonderful thing about this film is that it does not remove itself from the rules of reality. In so many fighting films, the glitz and glam seem to create more of a fantasy piece than anything even slightly believable. While the ending of this movie might not put a smile on your face, it certainly teaches a few valuable life lessons through an amazingly touching story. It shows you that it is the quality of your life, not the quantity of it, that will keep you remembered. I mean, wouldn't you rather live 35 years to the best that you could, and make all of your dreams come true, then live to 90 with doubts, regrets and lost dreams? I know my answer, and so does this film. Wonderful piece.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-09-12","","RT","793637045"
