4.5,"Maggie Fitzgerald (Swank) is a strong willed country girl from the ""boonies"" whose mother Earline (Margo Martindale) has never really given a damn about her other than to claim her as a dependent so she could get welfare.  She is a waitress but aspires to be a boxer and starts working out at famous yet ""supposedly"" washed up manager Frankie Dunn's (Eastwood) gym.  At first Frankie trys every attempt to get her to give up her dream and refuses to train her becasue of her age.  However with the help of Eddie ""scrap iron"" Dupris (Freeman), a former champion contender turned gym employee, convincing Frankie and her undying determination and commitment, she rises above the challenges of age and her past to the top of the women's boxing world.  Finally during the biggest match of her life she is then slapped with yet the hardest thing she or her manager has ever faced.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-12-06","","RT","805978356"
