5.0,"This is a Story of a 32 years old female boxer, played by (Hillary Swank). At an early age she experienced rejection and stimatization from people and families, nobody gave her a chance nor believed in her, even in the face of rejection she never stopped dreaming with a heart of warrior. the turning point of her life started when she meet coach Franky who trained a boxer for seven year before the boxer left him for a lucrative offer, her first encounter with Franky did not go well, but she did not give up, she kept on trainning trainning in the gym day and night , because boxing to her was her life and their was nothing anyone will say to her will that demoralize her.
it took the cleaner of the gym to notice
 her passion and williness to fight, the cleaner was played by Morgan Freeman who happens to be a Boxer but he stopped fighting because he had problem with his sight, every night the cleaner will give her some words of encuragement and trainning, but that was little he could do to help her be the best. One faithful morning Franky was convinced by the cleaner to train her be a professional boxer. then her quest in actaulizing her dreams in boxing started. this is movie is a most see. one of the best inspiring story with a strong massage of ""Never stop fighting.""","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-05-19","","RT","825517812"
