2.0,"Warning Rocky fans: This is not entertainment, not a pure boxing movie! It's a gray melancholy drama set in the world of boxing, about two people who have been deeply hurt or had a hard life resulting in difficulty in expressing emotions openly and letting others get close. And even if they lose each other in the end it'll be worth it because if nothing else they healed each other's emotional wounds and formed a bond breakable not even by the cold grip of death. I'll give this movie 2 stars instead of 4 - because I only enjoyed the first half - but instead of a build-up in the second half and the life-affirming ending I was expecting, it just left me depressed. I don't care if you think I don't get this movie, because believe me I do. It just doesn't make any difference for me.","",False,False,False,False,2.0,"2008-06-08","","RT","688858262"
