4.0,"Just finished watching it now. Got me a bit depressed but...only a really good movie can do that.
I already love Morgan Freeman and Clint Eastwood. This movie made me love them more. Their dialogues and their spirit made me a little less afraid of getting older.
The title of the movie implies a different ending. That's why I didn't watch it till 5 years later. But it's a much better movie than I expected.
There is almost no sound track. You just live the movie like a silent witness.  You get engrossed in it. You feel the different moments. You want to react...but you can't.
