5.0,"::WARNING, MAY CONTAIN SPOILERS::
This movie is excellent. Before this movie, I had never watched a movie starring or directed by Clint Eastwood, so I really didn't know what to expect.

This movie however, is a powerful movie. I believe one of the greatest flaws in American cinema is the Hollywood endings that most movies have. In reality, these endings are nearly impossible. 

This is exactly the reason I was disappointed in the movie, ""Crash."" Though it was an excellent movie, it was given a Hollywood twist to the ending.

