3.5,"This is a nice movie. Ending is unexpected. Boxing action are good. Hilary Swank is a thrifty waitress and one day finally managed to get Clint Eastwood to teach her boxing. Morgan Freeman is the caretaker around the gym. And she went on and became so good she often knock out her opponent within one round. Soon a title match was coming, and the opponent is a dirty fighter. During end of round 2, the opponent swing a punch at Hilary behind the referee's back and she fell and the neck hit onto the chair which Clint tried in vain to move when he saw it coming. And she end up paralyse. She couldn't even breath on her own. And she persistingly ask Clint to let her die. Finally he gave in, removing the ventilator and inject a lethal dose of adrenaline. He never return back to the gym. The movie brings us up to one level when the action flow begin and after the losing part, it went to sad mode.","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2009-03-08","","RT","299288383"
