5.0,"Finally got around to watching this (five years later, ha ha) and...wow. I completely understand why it won all of its awards, what a powerful film with great performances all around. Morgan Freeman is his usual dependable self in a supporting role, while Clint Eastwood shines as well as what you think is a bitter-old-man-mad-at-the-world role, but it is so much more than that. And then of course there is Hilary Swank, who turns in a magnificent performance as a waitress who's sole goal in life is to be a fighter trained by Eastwood. The story that unfolds and the bond that develops between those two is amazing to see, and also leads to a shocking ending...which you'll have to see for yourself.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-03-20","","RT","785820311"
