4.5,"Eastwood directs this dramatic film, as he stars together with Freeman the second time around, this is as good as dramatic as their last collaboration (Unforgiven).  This heart warming and heart breaking drama will make you cry as you watch the tragic ending of this brilliant film. The story is about a boxing trainer who strictly doesn't train girls, until his partner, a retired boxer, made him train a girl, who is desperately wanted him to train her, and instantly learned his way and knock every opponent on her way until *SPOILER ALERT* --just watch the film, it won't disappoint you, trust me!","a63dd5ef-a7e6-4fa9-8970-7b30a0063503",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2009-07-02","","RT","838341061"
