5.0,"What a wonderful movie!!!! I am not into boxer, UFC movie, or any kind of fighting movies, that's why I took so long to decide to watch this one. Thanks to my friends here, that recommended as a perfect one. It was. The actors (Clint Eastwood and Morgan Freeman) and the great actress, Hilary Swank were awesome. Isn't it a good story about love, passion and determination? It touched me so deeply. Yeah the artists are right, the art and the life, a very good complementary marriage. I am still stunned!!! I have to confess that I cried!!! Unforgettable. 

***********************************************************
Resisti muito em assistir este filme. Filmes que envolvem lutas, boxes, ou qualquer coisa do genero, realmente nao me atraem. Depois de ler algumas reviews aqui no rottentomatoes, eu decidi assistir. Grande estoria de amor, paixao e determinacao. Realmente tocante. os artistas estavam perfeitos e me emocionaram ate as lagrimas. A arte imita a vida!!! Perfeito. Imperdível!!!","b7995452-9f1f-4edb-91fe-b71cf4da2e6f",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-07-16","","RT","901274462"
