4.5,"Million Dollar Baby is a powerful, inspiring film that reaches the heart and creates a certain acknowledgement of how people's dreams can become reality if they pursue them. 
 There are religious, righteous and moral qualities in this excellent take on the life of a female boxer, played by Hilary Swank, and the at-first unwilling coach, played by the legendary Clint Eastwood. Their relationship blooms as the film progresses, which ushers how inspiring this woman boxer is; and her continuous valour and determination.  
 There is an array of humour, inspiring actions and sadness. A fatal twist is used in the film providing the emotional content which correctly illustrates it as a truly touching movie. 
 The events are unpredictable and appealing, the acting is very realistic, the genre is so varied! What else could you need in a film?","ef2bd38e-1f0b-47ee-96e1-0157b6b33059",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2010-01-06","","RT","901358421"
