4.5,"Clint is the Man Once Again!!!

What an emotional, well directed and acted movie. Seriously Clint Eastwood+Morgan Freeman= Greatness. Clint was the ultimate bad azz in his westerns now he's the old mean bastard you see in his modern films. Morgan Freeman's voice is unforgettable and he acting is beyond superb for his roles. Mentioning these two ive come to not ever remember them young LOL. These old dudes know how to do it!

On with the movie. This was a treat, sad, but a treat indeed. So f'n dramatic near the end but overall this was a great flick. Hilary Swank was also pretty damn impressive. I felt no false feelings in role in this film or better choice of words would simply be her role/acting was AUTHENTIC. Any film lover should definitely give this a viewing. Clint is among the great when it comes to direction!

But no film is perfect right? Here come the arguments lol. The only thing i didnt like about this film were to Rocky style fights, So unreal and telegraphed. I would of gave this movie a 5/5 but this was a big issue for me. But at the end of the day i Highly Recommend this film for owing and viewing.","a1eaa14e-dca1-4ed4-97d2-8063f5a6a6c6",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2010-10-11","","RT","905632227"
