5.0,"Mo cuishle.

A old and desperate boxing trainer reluctantly takes a feisty young woman as his new prodigy, the two quickly grow attached to each others company.

The first thing many people will notice when watching Million Dollar Baby is Hilary Swanks acting, its one of the best performances by an actress in recent memory. Condfident and energetic, swank plays the female boxer with a sexy accent and a sweaty forehead, invoking a strong tomboyish appearance with a dash of naivety thrown in for good measure.  The acting from the male lead and supporting cast are great as well, but nothing truly worth noting.

Swanks performance alone is enough to carry the film, but combined with excellent art direction, a great script and a pace that never lingers, Million Dollar Baby has few flaws, if any.","5d0c1ab5-6d24-47a5-8e2d-37e152effe10",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-11-02","","RT","905385592"
