3.5,"Through his long career I have always been able to count on Clint Eastwood for good movies.  Million Dollar Baby is no exception even though I don't think it deserves the raves that it received @ Oscar time.  On the surface it looks like a Rocky knock off quickly but turns sour becoming a story of euthanasia.  Honestly it caught me quite off guard because I wasn't expecting it.  Surprisingly this was able to get a tear out of me which is almost damn near impossible.  I must have been over tired w/ my defenses low.  Incredibly sad that is worth one view but probably no more then that.","ca27176b-5059-460c-934c-fd4161ea6bf6",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2011-06-10","","RT","799845961"
