4.5,"A fantastic film. 

While fairly predictable at times ""Million Dollar Baby"" features amazing acting, great action sequences, and plenty emotional power. Hillary Swank gives a knockout(no pun intended) performance. One of the best I have seen in years. She really plays her part perfect; she's sincere, happy, sad, angry, and fierce whenever she needs to be right on cue. Eastwood is amazing of course just as always. And Morgan Freeman is also great, never giving a below stellar performance in his life. 

There's also some scenes in the movie that are really quite emotional and sad. Such as when Swank shows her mom the new house, when Swank takes her great fall, and of course the big moment with Swank and Eastwood at the end. 

Overall an amazing experience:

4 and a Half out of 5 Stars","d94c2436-70e1-407f-81d3-9300126299e1",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2011-10-21","","RT","915501309"
