3.0,"This was a disappointment.  I'm not sure how else to phrase it: this movie was simple.  It was much, much too simple.  The world of the movie (outside of the 2 leads) is occupied by caricatures, and the leads' motives/histories are so painfully obvious it's exhausting.  Sure, I cried like a baby, but I was angry about itl.  This beat Finding Neverland and its well-earned tears for the Oscar, people.  And Sideways!  That's just wrong.

P.S. Clint Eastwood sounds like Batman.","26a42beb-32eb-42d3-883c-05a6f0dafe52",False,False,False,False,3.0,"2011-12-03","","RT","797233557"
