4.5,"Clint Eastwood is the master of Million Dollar Baby, on and off screen as both a wonderful protagonist and exceptional director. However, the star of the show is a remarkable Hilary Swank as the endlessly determined Maggie Fitzgerald, a woman who will never give up because to do so is to have nothing in life. Not only is she one of the most remarkable protagonists of the century, her relationship with Eastwood's Frankie Dunn is one of the most beautiful put to screen. Beautifully shot and featuring both a haunting score and gravelly Morgan Freeman narration, Million Dollar Baby is an artwork in modern cinema that doesnt entertain a single cliche.","f6852266-0f58-45d0-80e7-ce5775fed42f",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2014-06-06","","RT","959559416"
