5.0,"Million Dollar Baby is an emotional masterpiece that deserved its Best Picture Oscar. This movie is more than just a cliche ""girl who's an amateur at a sport and coach doesn't train her because of her gender"" movie. You know the acting is amazing when you don't see an extremely popular celebrity like Morgan Freeman as himself in a movie like this. The acting all around was great. I think the ending was done perfectly. This movie shows the essence of what family really is and what it means to people. This is one of my all time favorite sports movies and it is not only emotional and acted very well, but it is also inspiring and motivating.","29f46d8c-2c97-4d03-8d45-4797b2c9b019",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2020-07-12","","RT","978560209"
