3.0,"While some of the character interactions, especially those between Eastwood and Swank, are pretty great and the shocker with Maggie being a genuine surprise, I can't help but think that this movie had a lot of wasted potential. Between the awkward scenes, pacing and dialogue, I just can't seem to see why this movie was so well regarded. Nevertheless, it wasn't a bad movie, just one that I wouldn't reccomend.","eab5304b-7ac5-4986-8b7c-0c9772449887",False,False,False,False,3.0,"2021-02-10","","RT","977170552"
4.5,"This sports movie was very good. Clint Eastwood, Morgan Freeman, Hilary Swank, and the rest of the cast did a spectacular job in this movie. The plot of the movie was dramatic, inspirational, and dark. It's about fighting for what you really want and to do what is right for someone even if it's means doing something you'd never thought you'd do. If you haven't seen this movie yet, check it out sometime. It's a definite must see.","a0190321-dd6d-4eb8-b80d-35171033505b",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2021-02-20","","RT","9449b971-c86b-4ec9-97ea-74095b887f0f"
4.0,"It's almost unfair to refer to Clint Eastwood's Million Dollar Baby as a boxing movie as it is a film that is about so much more than boxing.  It is about fundamentally disparate characters brought together through a love of, or need for, boxing, trying to somehow give their seemingly empty lives some semblance of meaning and purpose.  The acting and writing are both beautifully understated, as is the subtly effective music score.  The final thirty minutes may feel as though it was tacked on for the sole purpose of sucking every ounce of emotion from the audience and comes across as being overdone and inconsistent with the tone of the rest of the film, but the movie is wonderful otherwise.","1184ea03-1e0a-4e3c-bbfc-b18d1bbde8ef",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2021-02-21","dave s","RT","2a1643d2-6913-4dea-9582-8d51686059df"
4.5,"Dramma potente, crudo e vero.
La sceneggiatura lo porta distante da qualsiasi altro film sul pugilato (nonostante ce ne siano tanti), e l'interpretazione di Hilary Swank, da Oscar meritatissimo, porta il prodotto ad un livello superiore.
Il lento finale è straziante, e porta in dono allo spettatore un mix di ansia e depressione da togliere il fiato.
Peccato per un po' di mancata attenzione ai personaggi di contorno e alle scene di pugilato non proprio perfette.","358cb5b7-04f7-478c-bc7b-a17a8a09611c",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2021-03-02","","RT","bda0402c-2353-432b-a72b-20b8e7f7c420"
4.0,"I should have included this in my ‘boxing movie' weekend last year... it would have been better than Creed II or Southpaw. ( See... I'm not sexist.)  Solid all around with convincing characters, horribly tragic turn of events that explains why guys don't want women to be boxers.","37931656-78fc-4ca8-abaa-ce989c93a827",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2021-03-04","","RT","e13e27ec-1a78-45a7-bdc6-33677e73145e"
5.0,"This film breaks out of the clichés of sports movies in which the American dream is extolled. It also has excellent performances (highlighting Hilary Swank's performance) and a very good direction by Clint Eastwood.","d0a5d69d-286c-4c0b-be91-a2602e8eabd2",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2021-03-25","","RT","979083424"
4.0,"Million Dollar Baby is a boxing movie that transcends expectations, and it's inherently emotional core packs a much stronger punch than it's on-screen action, which it does not lack. Both Clint Eastwood and Hilary Swank flawlessly outperform themselves here, Swank is an amazing physical actress who is able to show off her skills in every scene, regardless of whether or not she was boxing. As for Eastwood, this is actually my first time watching a Clint Eastwood film (acted or directed), and I can reliably say I'm entirely unsurprised as to how he gained his legendary reputation, which he lives up to 100%. My only problems with the film are the subplots (SPOILERS) involving Frankie's past, Danger, and the Gym, all of which remain unresolved, and left for the audience to figure out. The first of which, Frankie's past, seems like a rather important bit of information to leave out, especially since it looked like the movie was angling for it to be a plot point that Frankie would confront and grow past alongside his relationship with Maggie, but we get no such kind treatment. Alas, Million Dollar Baby is not a story about redemption, it's one of living life to the fullest, taking the shot while you still can, and the pain and loss one experiences from losing family. 4/5 for good story that could've been more coherent.","b241ff22-b068-47b6-91e0-6e37d5c6723d",False,False,False,True,4.0,"2021-04-14","","RT","978939431"
4.5,"Bellissimo film del grandissimo Clint Eastwood, il quale interpreta un personaggio indimenticabile in maniera magistrale e dirige il film splendidamente: colonna sonora, fotografia, regia e interpretazioni spettacolari.
Anche Hilary Swank è stata eccezionale!
Un finale straziante e commovente, un film che riflette circa temi profondi quali il suicidio, le relazioni umane, la vita e gli obiettivi della stessa.
Un racconto morale meraviglioso che tutti dovrebbero vedere!","16bb8ae2-50bf-48d9-8b1e-f2707d457e87",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2021-05-04","","RT","978951074"
4.0,"I can never understand why a great storyteller (Eastwood) would end this one the way he did . I've heard he had several other endings to choose from . This one is just depressing, even for Eastwood. It almost ruins the film , but , not really . The way the story got to the end makes this one one Eastwood's great films . Hillary Swank was riveting.","2ddc3940-a400-473f-9be2-dd8f6c110887",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2021-05-07","","RT","978094957"
4.0,"Powerful drama about a woman boxer. Hillary Swank win an Oscar, and the film won Best Picture.","bf2bcb58-2fee-460d-a26f-f0d0f83b60ab",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2021-05-10","","Flixster","72638a9f-2fe8-4c37-9dee-cb413cc330b2"
4.0,"No matter how dramatic this film is, I can't help but chuckle at the neck-breaking scene because it looks so corny. Other than that though, I think this movie works really well. There are some heavy emotional moments, the story of a strong woman bonding with the hardened old man training her, and some powerful performances from the leads. It's fantastic.","0ab8a5f3-c702-479e-90b8-c14b5c874d62",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2021-05-18","","RT","976511688"
5.0,"Powerful drama that represents the finest work by all involved.  Eastwood gives one of his finest lead performances as a wisen boxing coach saddled with guilt, getting a second chance thanks to an enthusiastic new prospect (a brilliant Hilary Swank).  He gets able support from Morgan Freeman as his one time friend, who provides his trademark narration at his finest.  Behind the camera, Eastwood directs an unflinching drama that transcends the cliches of the boxing drama, and doesn't hold back from its powerful ending.  Plus, his fights are crisp and exciting to watch.  Easily one of Eastwood best films.","02844e20-1833-4838-ab47-a76b7201e7e6",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2021-05-19","johnathon w","RT","158f8844-ee1c-4b07-8a2d-e24064693a2c"
